{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美元回軟，及市場對聯邦儲備局加息的憂慮降低，金價上升。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現貨金價企穩在4,400美元以上。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於紐約期金，收市報4,473.7美元一盎司，升36.4美元，升幅百分之0.81。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T00:37:57.529462+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}